  "details": "I got idea on group page, how about having new tab called \"Partner\" or \"Collab\"?\n\nThing to display there be like,\n\n*Instance List from partner group\n\n*Instance List with Group Name and Short description of that group\n\n=Usage Example=\n\nThere is group like VRCDN (https://vrchat.com/home/group/grp_caad1610-8d21-483d-82b1-42b8c7986ade) which is CDN service for streaming on club worlds.\n\nThere also be group which is for hosting event reguary (like weekly,monthly) which people may get interested.\n\nGet approved by group admin to listed as partners be best with it.\n\nIdea of this system is, connect those related groups together and make people easily find related event instance from upstream provider.",
